{"abstract":"This research explores the flow dynamics of digital innovation ecosystems, focusing specifically on the digital health sector. Drawing on the emerging flow-oriented perspective on digital transformation, we approach digital innovation ecosystems as self-organizing patterns of transformation. The study uses qualitative data from a Danish venture studio specializing in digital health ventures. It identifies three interweaving, co-responsive flows that orient transformation: psychosomatic flows of bodies, flows of biodata, and flows of medical research. The findings offer preliminary insights into how digital innovation ecosystems transform, highlighting the importance of understanding ecosystems as ongoing processes rather than fixed structures.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Tulinius, Mathias Tinghøj","Marton, Attila"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-774640"],"event":{"end":"2024-12-18","place":"Bangkok, th","start":"2024-12-15","title":"The 45th International Conference on Information Systems. ICIS 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Digital innovation ecosystems","Digital transformation","Flow oriented thinking"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"flowing with digital currents exploring the flow dynamics of digital innovation ecosystems","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://aisel.aisnet.org/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1272&context=icis2024","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-774640","ids":["cbs-c83ef034-5189-4668-b3f4-f5b3a1c666fd"],"keyword":["Digital innovation ecosystems","Digital transformation","Flow-oriented thinking"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-13AB2B5A2B9FCA78C3A00DE808AC454D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mathias Tinghøj","key":"tuliniuspau","last":"Tulinius","locid":"5f3e4735-d1b6-431f-b04a-3c36302cdff6","name":"Tulinius, Mathias Tinghøj","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Attila","key":"martonpau","last":"Marton","locid":"cf50dbec-f4aa-422e-96c9-91b534e68d1b","name":"Marton, Attila","orcid":"0000-0002-8947-6675","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Douglas","key":"vogelpedh","last":"Vogel","name":"Vogel, Douglas","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Heiko","key":"gewaldpedh","last":"Gewald","name":"Gewald, Heiko","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Assadaporn","key":"sapsomboonpedh","last":"Sapsomboon","name":"Sapsomboon, Assadaporn","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Andrew","key":"schwarzpedh","last":"Schwarz","name":"Schwarz, Andrew","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Christy","key":"cheungpedh","last":"Cheung","name":"Cheung, Christy","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Sven","key":"laumerpedh","last":"Laumer","name":"Laumer, Sven","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jason","key":"thatcherpedh","last":"Thatcher","name":"Thatcher, Jason","rank":9,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9781958200131"],"issn":["00000033"],"place":"Atlanta, GA","publisher":"Association for Information Systems. AIS Electronic Library (AISeL)","series":"Proceedings of the International Conference on Information Systems","status":"p","subtitle":"Digital Platforms for Emerging Societies","title":"Proceedings of the 45th International Conference on Information Systems (ICIS 2024)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105010822914"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-c83ef034-5189-4668-b3f4-f5b3a1c666fd"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Flowing With Digital Currents : Exploring the Flow Dynamics of Digital Innovation Ecosystems","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-774640","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"This paper explores the role of timing in digital entrepreneurship, specifically in the context of new venture creation (NVC). We challenge the conventional understanding of timing as catching the right moment and propose a flow-oriented perspective that emphasizes being in sync with temporal patterns and participating within a digital venture landscape. We problematize the existing assumptions of NVC, which focus on bounded digital technologies and intentional entrepreneurial perception and suggest alternative assumptions that consider the complex dynamics of digital transformation. Drawing on the concepts of flow, correspondence, and landscape, we propose avenues for future research into the temporal aspects of digital venture creation. By integrating insights from information systems research and entrepreneurship, we contribute to a better understanding of the interplay between digital technology and entrepreneurship in the timing of new venture creation.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Tulinius, Mathias Tinghøj","Marton, Attila"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-774263"],"event":{"end":"2024-06-19","place":"Paphos, cy","start":"2024-06-13","title":"The 32nd European Conference on Information Systems","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"temporalizing the digital venture landscape a flow oriented problematization of new venture creation","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://aisel.aisnet.org/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1141&context=ecis2024","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-774263","ids":["cbs-2758ab87-9c66-441d-83bc-05dd8cd99eee"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B30789C560C4F228F2658B7A4B6DAAF6"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mathias","key":"tuliniuspau","last":"Tulinius","locid":"5f3e4735-d1b6-431f-b04a-3c36302cdff6","name":"Tulinius, Mathias Tinghøj","name_org":"Tulinius, Mathias","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Attila","key":"martonpau","last":"Marton","locid":"cf50dbec-f4aa-422e-96c9-91b534e68d1b","name":"Marton, Attila","orcid":"0000-0002-8947-6675","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Michel","key":"avitalpedh","last":"Avital","name":"Avital, Michel","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Elena","key":"karahannapedh","last":"Karahanna","name":"Karahanna, Elena","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Marinos","key":"themistocleouspedh","last":"Themistocleous","name":"Themistocleous, Marinos","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ioanna","key":"constantioupedh","last":"Constantiou","name":"Constantiou, Ioanna","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Brian","key":"fitzgeraldpedh","last":"Fitzgerald","name":"Fitzgerald, Brian","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Stefan","key":"seidelpedh","last":"Seidel","name":"Seidel, Stefan","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9781958200100"],"issn":["00000034"],"place":"Atlanta, GA","publisher":"Association for Information Systems. AIS Electronic Library (AISeL)","series":"Proceedings of the European Conference on Information Systems","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 32nd European Conference on Information System. ECIS 2024"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-2758ab87-9c66-441d-83bc-05dd8cd99eee"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Temporalizing the Digital Venture Landscape : A Flow-oriented Problematization of New Venture Creation","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-774263","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"We present material-affective assemblage thinking as an alternate theoretical lens to sociomateriality in the study of scalar phenomena that scale multidimensionally and multitemporally. We argue that given their unbounded characteristics, such phenomena are challenging to study using sociomateriality that anchors ontological realism to intra-action contingent on observed practices, operating within bounded spaces. Inspired by Deleuze and Guattari, we propose an ontology of immanence where there are no inherent boundaries between bodies, only co-existence, and extension of assemblages through affective flows. Conceiving three conceptual devices – assemblages as virtual worlds, affects as flows, and time-space as rythmscapes – we exercise our theoretical lens on the case of the George Floyd big bang to illustrate how material-affective assemblage thinking can be used to research phenomena that flow as an ongoing process of becoming, agglomerating larger territories in co-functioning that transcend material, non-material, time, and space boundaries.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Patel, Shama","Tulinius, Mathias Tinghøj"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-285858"],"event":{"end":"2022-12-14","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2022-12-09","title":"The 43rd International Conference on Information Systems: ICIS 2022","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Affects","Assemblage","Deleuze and Guattari","Flows","SCALE","Sociomateriality"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"material affective assemblage thinking in researching scalar phenomena","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://aisel.aisnet.org/icis2022/adv_methods/adv_methods/7/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-285858","ids":["cbs-6d3b4722-3348-4ca2-bd2d-ca441d1f769e"],"keyword":["Affects","Assemblage","Deleuze and Guattari","Flows","Scale","Sociomateriality"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-18EDD258D7C78366BF5B45FC4EBE42C9"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Digitalization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Shama","key":"patelpau","last":"Patel","locid":"44cf647a-784b-4c7a-9240-05509ecff520","name":"Patel, Shama","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mathias Tinghøj","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"5f3e4735-d1b6-431f-b04a-3c36302cdff6","name":"Tulinius, Mathias Tinghøj","name_org":"Hansen, Mathias Tinghøj","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tilo","key":"böhmannpedh","last":"Böhmann","name":"Böhmann, Tilo","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Kai-Lung","key":"huipedh","last":"Hui","name":"Hui, Kai-Lung","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Viswanath","key":"venkateshpedh","last":"Venkatesh","name":"Venkatesh, Viswanath","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"issn":["00000033"],"place":"Atlanta, GA","publisher":"Association for Information Systems. AIS Electronic Library (AISeL)","series":"Proceedings of the International Conference on Information Systems","status":"p","subtitle":"Digitization for the Next Generation","title":"Proceedings of the 43 International Conference on Information Systems (ICIS)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-6d3b4722-3348-4ca2-bd2d-ca441d1f769e"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Material-Affective Assemblage Thinking in Researching Scalar Phenomena","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-285858","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
